      "text": "| Activity | Physical? | Competitive? | Sport? | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Marathon running | Yes, extreme | Yes | Yes | Consensus |\n| Chess | Minimal | Yes | Contested | FIDE recognized by IOC |\n| Esports | Minimal | Yes | Contested | Hand-eye coordination, reaction |\n| Motorsport | Driver moderate | Yes | Yes | Physical demands underestimated |\n| Darts | Minimal | Yes | Contested | Sky Sports treats it as sport |\n| Competitive eating | Yes (extreme) | Yes | No | Physical culture, not athletic |\n| Ballet | Yes, extreme | No (performance) | No | Art, physical culture |"
