      "text": "```\n:------------------------------------------------------------------:\n|                    SPORT TAXONOMY                                 |\n|                                                                  |\n|  COMBAT              BALL/PUCK          TRACK/FIELD              |\n|  --------            ----------         -----------              |\n|  Boxing              Association        Athletics (track)        |\n|  Wrestling           football           Athletics (field)        |\n|  Judo                American           Road running             |\n|  BJJ                 football           Cross-country            |\n|  MMA                 Basketball         Cycling                  |\n|  Fencing             Baseball           Speed skating            |\n|  Taekwondo           Cricket            Triathlon                |\n|  Karate              Rugby              Biathlon                 |\n|  Sumo                Hockey (ice)       Orienteering             |\n|  Muay Thai           Hockey (field)                             |\n|  Kendo               Volleyball                                  |\n|                      Tennis                                      |\n|                      Golf                                        |\n|                      Polo                                        |\n|                                                                  |\n|  WATER               TARGET             MOTOR                    |\n|  -----               ------             -----                    |\n|  Swimming            Archery            Formula One              |\n|  Diving              Shooting           Touring car              |\n|  Water polo          Darts              MotoGP                   |\n|  Rowing              Curling            Rally (WRC)              |\n|  Canoe/Kayak         Bowling            NASCAR                   |\n|  Sailing             Snooker/Billiards  IndyCar                  |\n|  Surfing             Bocce/Petanque     Le Mans endurance        |\n|  Synchronized swim                      Dragster                 |\n|                                                                  |\n|  WINTER              EQUESTRIAN         MIND/PRECISION           |\n|  ------              ----------         ----------------         |\n|  Alpine skiing       Show jumping       Chess (IOC recog.)       |\n|  Cross-country       Dressage           Bridge (IOC recog.)      |\n|  Ski jumping         Eventing           Esports (contested)      |\n|  Bobsled             Polo               Motorsimulation          |\n|  Luge/Skeleton       Horse racing                               |\n|  Curling             Harness racing                             |\n|  Ice dancing                                                     |\n:------------------------------------------------------------------:\n```"
