      },
      "text": "```\nRECREATIONAL\n  |  No affiliation, no competition, health/fun motivation\n  |  Pick-up basketball, weekend 5-a-side, club tennis\n  v\nAMATEUR COMPETITIVE\n  |  Club membership, local/regional competition, some cost\n  |  College club, community league, masters athletics\n  v\nSEMI-PROFESSIONAL\n  |  Supplemental income, part-time commitment\n  |  Lower-division football leagues, minor league baseball\n  v\nPROFESSIONAL\n  |  Primary income source, full-time commitment\n  |  NFL, Premier League, ATP Tour, NASCAR Cup\n  v\nELITE / OLYMPIC\n     Top 0.01% of athletes, state-funded programs,\n     performance science, anti-doping scrutiny\n     (Note: many elite athletes earn very little --\n      Olympic sports outside football/basketball/tennis)\n```"
    }
